Changes made to the copied files:
  - imports of isaaclab_arena_gr00t.* and isaaclab_arena.policy.action_scheduling are rewritten to
    policy_wrapper.*; PolicyBase, PolicyCfg and register_policy come from policy_wrapper/_arena.py,
    which imports them from Isaac Lab-Arena when it is installed;
  - gr00t_core.py: the isaaclab_arena_g1 constants are imported only in the G1 branch;
  - gr00t_closedloop_policy_config.py: fields `scheduler` and `bgr_conversion`;
  - gr00t_core.py: resize_rgb_for_policy takes `bgr_conversion`;
  - gr00t_remote_closedloop_policy.py: the policy config is the `client:` section of
    config/eval.yaml (policy_wrapper/eval_config.py), which also selects the scheduler; each request
    sends a sampling seed in `options`; registered as `policy_wrapper_gr00t_remote_closedloop`;
  - the test is re-pointed at the GR1 pilot configuration.

